Returns an object that implements `std::fmt::Debug` for a `value`
that has a `QDebug` operator.

Example:
```
use qt_core::{qdbg, QVectorOfInt};
# unsafe {
let x = QVectorOfInt::new_0a();
x.append_int(&1);
x.append_int(&2);
println!("{:?}", qdbg(x.as_ref()));
# }
```
